# Party chat choice test, part 1 (docs/re-party-chat.md section 9); run with --save on a party-chat
# build. Fountain Square with flag 0xB poked on: the example chat asks "Should I tell her I overslept?"
# with vanilla's YES/NO buttons; this plan answers the yes side (A): Jian tells the truth, flag 0x244 set (word 0x48 bit 0x10).
# Then Select, album No.1, save. chat_choice_reload.plan boots that save.
include boot_from_save
wait 60
poke u32 0x02204620 0x802
pin u16 0x020B77EC 164
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
wait 60
peek u16 0x020B6BE4 map
dump 0x02204668 0x4 choice_word_before
press Y 3
wait 120
shot yes_1_talk
press A 3
wait 90
shot yes_2_ask
press A 3
wait 60
shot yes_3_prompt
press A 3
wait 90
shot yes_4_side
dump 0x02204668 0x4 choice_word_after_pick
press A 3
wait 90
shot yes_5_side
press A 3
wait 90
shot yes_6_hint
press A 3
wait 90
shot yes_7_field
dump 0x02204620 0x5C flags_saved
press Select 3
wait 100
press A 3
wait 40
press A 3
wait 60
press A 3
wait 120
press A 3
wait 60
wait 120
shot yes_8_saved
